// `changed` is a field getting another value (Inputs/changed_same.ent): a
// `for` that writes a cell every frame sets off the one that reacts to
// it only in the frames where what it writes is another value.
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/changed_same.ent 2>/dev/null | FileCheck %s
// RUN: %ent run --parallel %S/Inputs/changed_same.ent 2>/dev/null | FileCheck %s

// New, so once.
// CHECK:      1: seen 1
// CHECK-NEXT: 2: seen 1
// Another v.
// CHECK-NEXT: 3: seen 2
// CHECK-NEXT: 4: seen 2
// Another f.
// CHECK-NEXT: 5: seen 3
// CHECK-NEXT: 6: seen 3
